  "reproducibility_interpretation": "This executed manifest binds the Stage 1.3 baseline reproduction, mechanism-isolation matrix, curated reports, demonstrations, sensitivity outputs, and documentation to the tested source/configuration commit, pinned OCPE commit, solver settings, and dependency environment. Artifact hashes support exact record verification; they do not establish physiological or clinical validity. All declared executable layers pass without scientific expected failures. Overall scientific readiness is PARTIAL because of calibration overlap, the exploratory nonlinear form, narrow empirical/scenario margins, parameter non-identifiability, residual healthy MAP over-defence, and absent independent patient/population validation. Historical Stage 1.2, Stage 1.1, and Stage 0 hashes and records are retained. The manifest itself is not self-hashed.",
  "seed_interpretation": "Seed 0 is recorded where applicable; simulations and scenario grids are deterministic and contain no synthetic patients or stochastic cohort.",
  "limitations": [
    "Source checkout or OCPE_DM_ROOT is required for configuration and registry discovery.",
    "Trailing numerical digits may vary across platforms and dependency builds; execution_date legitimately changes on later regeneration.",
    "All eight CO/SV comparisons are within preserved bands, but only the four 60-degree rows are direct experimental-angle comparisons; the four 70-degree rows are extrapolated model-specific criteria. All retain calibration overlap and are not independent validation.",
    "Direct 60-degree CO clears the lower band edge by only 0.081 percentage points; neuropathic POTS clears the 30 bpm criterion by only 0.093 bpm.",
    "All POTS phenotypes and Long-COVID-autonomic pass unchanged scenario criteria; this is not diagnostic accuracy, patient fitting, or clinical validation.",
    "Healthy 70-degree upright-end MAP is 102.253 mmHg from a 100 mmHg supine baseline; residual pressor over-defence remains.",
    "The one-sided quadratic dependent-elastance form and 0.0001 coefficient are exploratory structural assumptions, not measured tissue properties; zero recovers Stage 1.2.",
    "Common anatomy removes unsupported phenotype-specific height overrides but does not establish identical human anatomy. Neuropathic gains and hEDS compliance remain unmeasured scenario assumptions.",
    "The healthy gain-ranking grid is intentionally asymmetric around the Stage 1.3 nominal to include the Stage 1.2 legacy endpoint; it is not a statistical uncertainty interval.",
    "The ME/CFS PEM scenario crosses 0.05 approximately 5.7 hours after the day-1 bout ends, earlier than the 12-48-hour daily-activity onset window but within reported post-CPET onset within 24 hours.",
    "Audit commits 6034d11d4737bca5d3b6d853900a69690ab90907 and 2d1283f are unavailable; exact available Stage 1.1/1.2 source revisions were reproduced instead.",
    "One optional upstream-checkout adapter test is skipped; strict installed-engine OCPE package validation and declarative/executable consistency tests pass separately.",
    "No independent clinical validation, wearable sensor/error model, Stage 2 dataset, Stage 3 predictor, or verified remote CI matrix result is provided."
  ],
  "commit_binding_policy": "repository_commit and last_validated_commit identify the final tested source/configuration commit. The subsequent release-record commit adds regenerated curated demonstrations, executed reports, this manifest, current-status documentation, provenance wording, and registry result metadata; it is not represented as a source revision tested before it existed. Any later source or scientific configuration change requires a new validation cycle.",
